It's the **`functions`** property. Its keys are glob patterns that match function files, and you set `maxDuration` (in seconds) for each pattern:

```json
{
  "functions": {
    "api/*.js": { "maxDuration": 30 }
  }
}
```

Source: https://vercel.com/docs/project-configuration/vercel-json. I checked
